Subject: [PATCH 03/37] docs: deep idle and deep sleep research for T6020

What idle and sleep states exist on the M2 Pro, what Linux reaches today
(CPU deep WFI with retention, s2idle only), what macOS does (XNU), why raw
boot mode is enough for the CPU side on M1-M3 but not M4+, what blocks SoC
sleep, the measurements behind it, the hv tracing plan, and the PMP test
procedure with rollback.

